  "description": "用《高性价比人生指南》正文回答人生决策：先查 765 条条目再回答，按成本与收益排序，每条注明第几节第几条。注册 life-decision-guide skill 与三个查询工具。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "(MIT AND CC-BY-4.0)",
  "author": "MonkeyGarry",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/MonkeyGarry/dsh-life-decision-guide",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/MonkeyGarry/dsh-life-decision-guide.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/MonkeyGarry/dsh-life-decision-guide/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "skill",
    "life-decision-guide",
    "人生决策",
    "高性价比人生指南"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
